window.products.push({"id":848165,"name":"Sandicast Gold and White Shih Tzu Holding Stocking Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kVi1mWSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pets are such an important part of our lives and our families. And, when Christmas rolls around, they love the festivities just as much as we do. Sandicast's charming collection of christmas ornaments features over 40 different breeds of man's best friend enjoying the holiday spirit in a variety of ways: some sport bright red santa hats or are cozily wrapped in winter scarves, others are decked out in strings of lights or carrying christmas stockings. Several breeds are also available in multiple expressions and poses (sitting, standing, lying, sitting pretty or crouching), each one \"decorated\" for holidays in a different way. Sandicast christmas ornaments have a securely attached metallic cord loop for hanging and are packaged in a protective reusable box that's perfect for year-round storage. Don't feel like putting that special ornament away just because the holidays are over. Go ahead, enjoy it all year, we won't tell. Sandicast was founded in 1981 when artist Sandra Brue realized her dream of combining her artistic talent and her lifelong love of animals. Because of the superb quality of her work, collectors around the world now pursue the demand for Sandicast animal sculptures. Queen Elizabeth and president Clinton are just a few of the many celebrities that have Sandicast animals. Sandra has sculpted more than 400 animals; the Sandicast collection includes everything from dogs and cats to exotic wildlife. Each piece is hand-cast and hand-painted and virtually comes to life when sparkling glass eyes are inserted. Sandicast invites you to discover their extensive collection of hand sculpted animals available on amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kVi1mWSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandicast","source_asin":"B014KM34FG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014KM34FG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014KM34FG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":848166,"name":"fullengy Cervical Memory Foam Pillow, Contour Pillows for Neck, Shoulder, Back Pain Relief, Ergonomic Neck Contoured Support Pillow for Side, Back, St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W+49WDCPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎟 REDUCE NECK & BACK PAIN -- Proven ergonomically designed, Fullengy contoured memory foam pillow supports your head, neck, shoulders and back perfectly, which can bring a reduction of stress in the cervical vertebra and spine. So you will wake up relaxed without any neck and shoulder pain. And this pillow is comfortable whether you are back sleeper, stomach sleeper, or side sleeper ♥ ERGONOMIC DESIGN & QUALITY MATERIAL -- Pillows play a crucial role in pain. With the butterfly shape, neck contour, and central cavity, our contour pillow can support by following the natural curve of your body, and give your arms armrests. The hole inside was designed to cradle your head for optimal support and reduce the pressure of the skull ❣ TWO HEIGHTS & ARMREST DESIGN -- The size of the pillow is 25.6 x 14.2 x (3.1 - 5.5 ) inch (L*W*H). Back sleepers with cervical issues can sleep on the higher side (5.5 inch) of the pillow with 2 horns as this side provides better support for the head and cervical. All the other back/side sleepers can sleep on the lower side (3.1inch). And the armrest design offers specific grooves that allows your arms to go under for comfortable sleep 🧮 HIGH QUALITY MEMORY FOAM PILLOW -- The cervical pillow is made of premium and breathable memory foam with a CertiPUR-US certified rebound time of 3 to 5 seconds, which can keep its shape and firmness for long term use. And the pillow cover is made of 100% polyester that can let you fees silky soft and cool. All materials are breathable, skin-friendly, and chemical free 💦 REMOVABLE BREATHABLE PILLOWCASE -- The Cervical Memory Foam Pillow with breathable fabric cover allows extra airflow into the pillow to keep the pillow cool while you sleep. It is gentle on your skin to stay crisp throughout the night. And the the pillowcase is removable with zippered & machine washable 💝 It's the optimum neck pillows for people who needs pain relief, no matter for elders, office workers, teachers, IT, or having sleep disorders 👨‍⚕️ NOTE: IF YOU NEED TO USE IT FOR REHABILITATION, PLEASE ASK YOUR DOCTOR FOR ADVICE FIRST. 🌞 Memory foam will have a slight polyurethane smell, and the smell may be more obvious after passing through a high temperature and airtight transportation environment. This is a normal phenomenon. Before first use, unzip and remove the lid and leave the memory foam flat in a well-ventilated area for 1-3 days until it fully expands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W+49WDCPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fullengy","source_asin":"B0C5XJT97N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5XJT97N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5XJT97N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
