window.products.push({"id":848183,"name":"Tappecue - True Wi-Fi Thermometer, Made in USA | 4 x Dual Sensor Probes(2 in 1, Measure Meat and Ambient in 1 Probe) 8 Readings for Grill BBQ Smokers,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ujaW+xnZL._AC_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY MEAT BBQ THERMOMETER: Tappecue Touch has a number of probe options and all the add-ons you need for a great life. Made and supported in USA with TRUE WI-FI which lets you connect and view your settings remotely, you can read up to 8 temperatures with this grill Thermometer. 2 x DUAL SENSOR PROBES (NOW COMES WITH 2 ADDITIONAL FREE DUAL SENSOR PROBES): This Touchscreen Probe Thermometer for grilling boasts 4 dual sensor probes for reading the temp of the meat and the ambient temperature of the smoking chamber. You can read 8 temperatures with just 4 probes And the best, you will know the chamber temperature at the exact spot you are cooking! Wonder why the meat finishes at different times. No spot is the same! . COOK WITH FREEDOM: Have a big game to watch? Want to spend more time with the kids? Just throw your food on the grill and you’re all set! No need to worry about burning dinner or running back and forth in the kitchen. This wifi grill thermometer lets you show off all your culinary skills without taking away valuable time. A great indoor/outdoor thermometer that conveniently lets you monitor your cooking through your phone. SMART HOME APP AND BLOWER ADD-ONS: Your Tappecue Touch Grill Thermometer works with your Alexa app and other Android and iOS devices, & boasts an optional slot for pairing a blower to inject more oxygen for increased heat and stronger smoke flavor. To repeat excellent results, simply login to the WIFI storage and retrieve saved settings. MEAT THERMOMETER FOR EVERYONE: Just beginning your BBQ journey or attained pro status? This Oven Thermometer for meat is right for you. Access data from anywhere with or without Wi-Fi, and take readings simultaneously with our advanced Oven Thermometer Grilling Accessories Kit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ujaW+xnZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tappecue","source_asin":"B06WRMQJYD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WRMQJYD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WRMQJYD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
