window.products.push({"id":848322,"name":"Oversized Extra-Large Terry Cotton Beach Towe, 40x70\", Soft Absorbent and Dry Fast for Swimming Pool, Beach and Spa-Surfs Boards","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+btBERcKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The J & M Home Fashions fiber reactive beach towels are a great combination of quality, absorbency, fashion, and fuction! These towels are perfect for the pool, beach, lake, boat, and more. After a swim in the ocean, lake or pool, wrap yourself up in one of these beautiful beach towels. With 4 unique designs, you are sure to impress your friends and family with the bright and vibrant colors that are included. These beach towels are soft and absorb moisture quickly and efficiently, making drying off a breeze. These towels are fade resistant as well. The towels are offered in the following styles: Cabana Stripe Beach Chairs, Dophins and Fish, Summer Sandals, Sunglasses, Sunset Palm Trees, Underwater Turtle, Beach Umbrella, Dolphin Reef, Surfs Up, Tropical Palm Trees. Beach towels measure 30 inches by 60 inches and are 100% high quality cotton construction. From the Manufacturer J&M Home Fashions is a direct importer and wholesale company with distribution to both retailers and e-commerce channels. J&M has grown to become one of the most respected names in home fashion through innovation, service, quality and commitment to global manufacturing capabilities. With over 60 years of experience, J&M has a unique expertise in design, manufacturing and delivery – providing customers with excellent quality products at affordable pricing. Our products span the market spectrum and we consistently deliver the highest quality for value in the industry. J&M Home Fashions offers fashionable, fun and functional rugs, educational children's rugs, doormats, utility mats, blankets, throws, kitchen textiles, bath towel ensembles, bath rugs, beach towels, shower products and more…for the home. Within these categories we offer variety, including everyday basic looks and seasonal collections for Back to School, Halloween, Fall/Harvest, Christmas/Holiday, and Spring & Summer. Our offerings incorporate the hottest colors and themes bringing you fresh, innovative products for every season, every holiday, every home, and everyone","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+btBERcKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J&M Home Fashions","source_asin":"B00XEL9NBO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XEL9NBO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XEL9NBO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":848323,"name":"ESAER Cotton Washcloths ,Hand Towels Set 100% Cotton Premium Ring Spun Cotton Ultra Soft & Highly Absorbent Washcloths 31 x 15.7 inches Bath Wash Face","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c0gsNvVWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Material Wash Cloths】This hand towel well made with 100% thicken combed cotton. The fiber length is longer and the woven yarn that more delicate and comfortable to adults, kids and babies skin 【High Absorbent Hand Towel】Using combed untwisted yean technology the hair ring is soft and flat makes it more absorbent, especially after you wash hand, using it to wipe lets your hands get dry and warm soon. In addition, it can be used as kids or baby towel to clean little hand and face, with 100% cotton that very soft and cozy to kid’s skin 【Safety Class A/B Face cloths】This fingertip towel is \"0\" added, no formaldehyde. Compliance with textile safety and environmental standards. This Combed Cotton texture can make towel fresh and odor free after using it. You may only find this quality in luxury department store. In addition, It can be use as a cleaning wash rags, kitchen bathroom wash cloths that more convenient to wipe spill and dust in the house to keep home neat and tidy 【Towel Tips】Use a towel for the first time, please clean it separately. The fingertip towels is 100% cotton, You may see some cotton velvet during the first wash that will reduce after a few wash. This will not affect the use and performance of towels. Please do not put it into the washing machine to clean, or iron. Avoid destroying the fiber structure of the towel 【Best Washcloths】Created by a group of designers from all over the world, we don't define style but we aims to break the boundary between artistic aesthetics and daily life to bring an efficient and high-quality life experience. If you have any questions about this high quality towel, please feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c0gsNvVWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ESAER","source_asin":"B09BC4ZHCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BC4ZHCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BC4ZHCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":848324,"name":"ROCK SPACE Portable Personal, Small, Black Blender 7","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BboYJh5TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Indulge in fresh citrus for cooking, cocktails or a splash of flavor in salad dressings and marinades using our simplistically designed PrepWorks by Progressive Citrus Juicer. Lemons, limes and oranges release their juices when pressed onto the reaming lid. This citrus juicer pulls double-duty as a hand reamer and countertop juicer. The hollow handle collects and measures freshly squeezed juice, which can then be poured from the convenient pour spout, while the non-skid base helps keep it in place. This juicer can hold up to 4 tablespoons or 60 milliliters of liquid. For over 40 years, our mission has been to create innovative kitchen tools and gadgets that make food preparation fun and fast while inspiring culinary creativity. From our thinstore™ collapsibles to our sophisticated PL8™ line, our dedication to providing quality products supported by superior customer service continues to drive our creative development today. At Progressive International, we continually strive to understand the needs of today’s cooks. Our team includes talented, energetic and passionate people committed to reimagining the kitchen. We strive to pass our passion on to our consumers through our thoughtfully designed tools, layered with our avid desire to go beyond the expected. Our philosophy is simple: offer stylish designs complimented by no-nonsense functionality. We understand the kitchen is the heart of the home, where families and friends connect.  Our ongoing mission is to provide exceptional kitchen essentials that help cooks of all skill levels create meals worth sharing. Prep Solutions;, Prepworks and PL8 continues to build on the Progressive; legacy by offering products that make food prep faster, easier and more enjoyable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BboYJh5TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B014KT9PYI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014KT9PYI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014KT9PYI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
