window.products.push({"id":848427,"name":"REAHOME 12 Drawer Dresser for Bedroom Fabric Storage Tower Wide Rustic Dresser with Wood Top Sturdy Steel Frame Storage Organizer Unit for Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":105.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YS1YBWS2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【Portable & Easy to Assemble】 Black dresser size: 38.98’’L x 11..81’’W x 43.31’’H. Installation videos and instructions help you easily assemble the 12 drawer dresser. It is easy for you to assembly it within 30 minutes. This fabric drawer dresser is suitable for bedroom,living rooms, corridors, closets, entrances, nurseries, university dormitories, offices, etc. ❤【High Quality & Durable】The sturdy steel frame and durable MDF wooden waterproof countertop provide reliable strength and stability. This top-board is durable, easy to wipe and clean, and air-dried quickly after using a damp cloth. This rustic brown folding drawer (non-wood drawer) is made of fabric,The realistic wood appearance and texture is durable and easy to take care of, enhancing the sense of advanced. ❤【Structural Stable】The strong steel frame and waterproof MDF wood top provide reliable strength, and the roof supported by the steel frame can improve stability and durability. The four adjustable feet can be used on uneven ground and avoid scratches on the ground. The 12 drawer dresser can be fixed to the wall using Anti dumping device to avoid potential safety hazards to children at home. ❤【Multifunctional Storage】 REAHOME storage tower unit with 12 separate drawers helps you sort items by type.6 large drawers and 6 small drawers to satisfy your different storage needs. Drawers are great for organizing your clothes, blankets, scarves, socks and other accessories.Use in or out of the closet and keep clutter under control by storing all of your clothing and accessories in one convenient place. Wood top provides a hard surface to place lamps, books, decor, and more. ❤【High Service】REAHOME: Simple and unfading life. Every product we provide meets all North American safety standards, so you can easily enjoy cost-effective products. If you have any question about the product, please contact us directly. We will reply you within 24 hours to ensure you can have a perfect shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YS1YBWS2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REAHOME","source_asin":"B0BCFL9Y95","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCFL9Y95","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCFL9Y95","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
