window.products.push({"id":848721,"name":"Le French Pantry Herbes De Provence, 2 Count, 1 Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OfYqa3dgL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Herbes De Provence are ubiquitous in French cooking, and when I use them in our meals at home, my partner and I are without fail transported back to France, our meal a mis-mash of flavors we’re enjoying now and those of memories past. Our take on the blend is loaded with extra lavender, imparting a special flavor notes and beautiful, vibrant purple-hued accents. My favorite use with this gourmet herb blend is the classic baked ‘Fish Provencal’, but we use it to add depth to our meatball mix, add a pop of flavor to roast veggies, and add a final sprinkle to top mashed potatoes for a gorgeous pop of color and lingering savory flavor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OfYqa3dgL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le French Pantry","source_asin":"B07GKYWL3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GKYWL3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GKYWL3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":848722,"name":"Electric Automatic Salt or Pepper Grinder, Pepper or Salt Mill Grinder USB Rechargeable, Upgraded Ultra-Larger Capacity with 3 Replaceable Container, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713ZJQZ0HdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍 UPGRADED ULTRA LARGER CAPACITY--These salt and pepper grinder set has 3X larger storage capacity than other electric grinders. It holds about 170g salt or 80g pepper so you are refilling less often.Two extra storage capacity to keep the different spices fresh. 👍 CAN'T BEAT ONE HANDED OPERATION -- No more twisting with manual grinder! Our salt and pepper shakers allows you to add your favourite spices with one hand while handling food. Great for home chef, children, the elders and those who have arthritis. 👍 NO MORE BATTERIES!! -- These automatic grinders are rechargeable, as opposed to many other grinders that require batteries to grind! Recharge them using a USB-C cord (2 pack included) and single charge lasts for at least continuous 180 minutes，which meet your needs anywhere, anytime. 👍 ADJUSTABLE GRIND COARSENESS -- The electric salt and pepper grinder set allowing you to choose between a coarse to very powdery fine grind. The upgraded electric motor is capable of reaching 9000RPM and produces an even grind at every coarseness setting. 👍 HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL--Grinder with ABS & PC material and non-slip design, provides a comfortable feel for the grinder.Top quality Ceramic Rotor offers long time durability and can grind against the toughest peppercorns, sea salt or other spices. 💡 LED LIGHT -- It has a built-in LED light that comes on when you use it so you can see how much seasoning you are putting on your food. 👍 ERGONOMIC DESIGN -- Clear PC container lets you see when it’s time to refill & a cover on the bottom to protect against dust, humidity and reduce mess from accidentally hitting the button. 👉 NOTE--The grinder is initially designed to be tightened to the smallest gap, please adjust the gap first after grinding according to the demand of powder size after receiving the goods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713ZJQZ0HdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lynker","source_asin":"B0BXLB276S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXLB276S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXLB276S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
