window.products.push({"id":848871,"name":"Univinlions Heavy Duty Kitchen Axe Forged Bone Cleaver Cool Multipurpose Hatchet with Carved Alloy Dragon Handle for Home, Outdoor Camping, Hiking Bir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MbrFXMHBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL - The kitchen bone axe is made of premium High Manganese Steel, combines traditional blacksmithing skills with modern science and technology to ensure high sharpness and high wear resistance, outperforming common high carbon steel knife. You need to hand-wash it after each use, keep it clean and dry to resist rust. With reasonable maintenance, the bone cleaver will last a long lifetime. ULTRA SHARP & SAFE BLADE- The sturdy bone knife blade is with a 18° V-shaped blade edge. The precise edge minimizes cutting resistance, helps you cut bones effortlessly neatly like chopping through butter. The unique branded dragon and flame pattern on the tomahawk axe blade makes it pretty and anti-sticking, easy to clean and maintain. CARVED GOLD DRAGON HANDLE - The 6.3 inches long ergonomic carved dragon alloy handle is energy saving, antiskid, comfortable to hold and control than wood ones. You will not fatigued even after prolonged use! It’s made of golden alloy, not gold-plated, the gold will never fade. Equipped with a pretty portable leather sheath, you can put a belt on it to carry around when you are having a barbecue, hunting, caming, hiking and doing other outdoor activities. MULTIPURPOSE - This multi-function heavy duty hatchet can perfectly cutting ribs, chopping big bones, cutting trees, splitting firewood and so on. It is suitable for professional chefs, amateurs and outdoor adventurer to use at home kitchen and in outdoor or for collection. RISK-FREE - As a professional kitchen Knives manufacturer, we focus on offering more quality chefs knives to improve more customers’ daily life. We provide 30 days unconditional return and 12 months warranty against faulty materials or workmanship. Everything is for ensuring Your Pleasant and Risk-Free Purchase! This is an ideal kitchen gift for your family and friends on Birthday, Anniversary, Christmas and others.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MbrFXMHBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"univinlions","source_asin":"B09X4398RP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X4398RP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X4398RP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
