window.products.push({"id":848909,"name":"Saffron Marigold – Lavender Dreams – Lilac, Green, and White Floral Hand Printed – Elegant Romantic Sheer Cotton Voile Curtain Panel – Tab Top or Rod ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sJgrEamgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Saffron Marigold Lavender Dreams Curtain Panel Evoking French lavender fields as they meet the Mediterranean sun, our Lavender Dreams cotton curtains bring elegant warmth to your home. Hang against a pale blue wall and accent with whitewashed furniture and fresh flowers. Incorporate rustic found objects along with crisp white elements for a timeless Provencal look. Features 100% cotton voile 100% cotton voile Tab Top (length 63in, 84in): Includes five tabs, 3”W x 4”H for easy hanging Tab Top (length 63in, 84in): Includes five tabs, 3”W x 4”H for easy hanging Use option of Rod Pocket by threading the curtain rod through the 3”H pocket. Note: by doing so you lose 4 inches in tab length Use option of Rod Pocket by threading the curtain rod through the 3”H pocket. Note: by doing so you lose 4 inches in tab length Color-matched tieback included with all lengths. Color-matched tieback included with all lengths. Wash & Care: Machine wash separately in cold water with a gentle or eco friendly detergent. Do not soak. Do not use bleach or a detergent with bleach additives. Tumble Dry warm. Iron using cotton settings. Inspiration for Lavender Dreams The heart of every perfect summer is captured in the sweet fragrance of the most nostalgic of all flowers, lavender. The evocative flower conjures up images of warm idyllic summers walking through fields of lavender, embracing the wondrously seductive power of its scent and is the inspiration for our latest print \"Lavender Dreams\". The print has a quintessential country cottage feel to it. Set against a creamy ground the lavender motifs have a graceful sculptural quality to them and are rendered in shades of lilac, amethyst and deep forest green.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sJgrEamgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B001ACOMYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001ACOMYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001ACOMYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
