window.products.push({"id":848988,"name":"SIRUITON Bag Storage Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, New plastic Dispenser Organizer, Compatible with Gallon, Quart, Sandwich and Snack Variety Size Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R3VfkNZjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STORAGE BAG ORGANIZER-Food storage bag holder keeps your kitchen and drawer clean, tidy and organized, special designed for storage the messy plastic bags in your drawer by category, no more mismatched and torn up broken boxes in your kitchen drawer. WIDE COMPATIBLE-This ziplock bag storage organizer is perfectly compatible with ziplock bags of different sizes from most popular brands, such as Ziploc, Solimo, Hefty, Up & Up, Glad & GreatValue, ideal size for quart, sandwich, candy, snack and gallon bags. PREMIUM ECO-MATERIAL-Our bag storage box is made of food grade New material, BPA free, different from bamboo wood made which is easy to crack, deform or even apart. Our bag storage box is integrally formed, no need glue or paint for bonding and splicing, it is not easy to crack, deform or have peculiar smell. KEEP LID TIGHT- The sandwich bag storage box with top cover can be easily opened, and it can be kept tightly when it is closed, ensuring that the cover will not fall off when the bag is pulled out or wall mounted, which increases the tightness performance. At the same time, it is convenient to put ziplock bags of different sizes. In addition, it is lighter (only 640g), which will not increase the pressure of the drawer guides to affect the service life of the drawers. EASY TO CLEAN & USE- The snack quart baggie holder is simple in style with innovative patented design, no assembly is required because the box is integrally formed. Moreover, it is more durable than bamboo wood made as no any bonding or splicing required, it will not crack even if it is dropped from a high place, at the same time it is easier to use and maintain, you can wash it directly with water or wipe it with a damp cloth, suitable for long-term use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R3VfkNZjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIRUITON","source_asin":"B09W21FJ4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-848988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W21FJ4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W21FJ4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
